{
  "id": "dmw7kff5zssvl",
  "name": "边缘拖拽缩放",
  "tags": [
    "拖拽",
    "交互"
  ],
  "summary": "拖动面板右下角的缩放手柄调整宽高，拖动时显示实时尺寸，松手停在当前位置。",
  "usage": "需要用户自定义大小的容器：预览窗、便签、可调宽度的侧栏、画布区域。",
  "caution": "只读内容不要开放缩放；同屏多个可缩放面板要错开手柄热区；移动端手柄至少 20px，否则很难按中。",
  "hint": "按住右下角的小手柄拖动",
  "prompt": "【边缘拖拽缩放】目标：一个图片容器，四个角各有一个白色圆角小方块手柄；按住任一角拖动改变容器尺寸，底部实时显示「宽度 N px / 高度 N px」。\n\n1) 尺寸跟视口走：stage 在弹窗里 460×300，`@media (max-height:420px)` 压回 280×112；初始容器按舞台 62%（保底 150×80）。\n\n2) 四角手柄完整显示：容器不要 overflow:hidden，手柄用 -6px 挂在角外。\n\n3) 右下角拖动时左上角坐标不动：容器 position:absolute，left/top/width/height 全由 JS 控制。\n\n4) **拖动计算方式（关键）**：\n   - 右/下角：`W = max(MINW, baseW + dx)`、`H = max(MINH, baseH + dy)`；\n   - 左/上角：**对边固定**——`R = baseL + baseW`，`L = clamp(baseL + dx, 0, R - MINW)`，`W = R - L`；上边同理用 `B = baseT + baseH`，`T = clamp(baseT + dy, 0, B - MINH)`，`H = B - T`。\n   - **不要写成「T 和 H 各自独立夹取」**：那样拖出上边界后 T 被钳在 0、H 却还在按 dy 增长，会出现「鼠标继续往上、面板反而往下拉伸」的反直觉现象（实测被指出来过）。\n   - 最后再统一做 `L+W ≤ stage.width`、`T+H ≤ stage.height` 的收缩。\n\n5) 手柄：12px 白色圆角方块（3.5px 圆角、1.5px 中性描边、轻微阴影），hover/拖动中描边变品牌色。不要用斜线角标。\n\n6) 视觉：拖动中容器边框变品牌色 + 3px 品牌色淡光环；尺寸栏实时更新。\n\n7) 无障碍：每个手柄 role=\"separator\" + aria-label + tabindex=\"0\"；方向键 ±8、Shift ±32。\n\n8) 坑：不要给 width/height 加 transition；手柄 touch-action:none；pointerup / lostpointercapture 都要结束拖动。\n\n9) 配色：边框 var(--ui-border)，手柄与高亮 var(--ui-brand)。\n\n10) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（光标移到右下角 → 按下 → 拖大 → 松开 → 停 1 秒 → 缩回）；演示光标逐帧跟随。\n\n11) 使用场景：图片/画布容器的自定义大小；只读内容不开放；移动端手柄加大到 20px。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;padding:20px}\n\n/* 弹窗里给足空间；卡片预览（≤420 高）再压缩 */\n.stage{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:460px;height:300px}\n\n.frame{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:280px;height:190px;\n  border-radius:12px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  transition:border-color .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease}\n.frame.dragging{border-color:var(--ui-brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent)}\n\n.frame .label{position:absolute;left:11px;top:9px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;\n  color:var(--ui-brand);opacity:.85;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none}\n.frame .ph{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:64%;height:56%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\n  border-radius:10px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 13%,transparent);\n  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,transparent);pointer-events:none}\n\n/* 四角白色圆角小方块；容器不裁切，方块才能完整显示在角外 */\n.h{position:absolute;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3.5px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 45%,transparent);\n  box-shadow:0 1px 3px color-mix(in srgb,#000 16%,transparent);\n  touch-action:none;transition:border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease}\n.h:hover{border-color:var(--ui-brand);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 10%,var(--ui-surface))}\n.frame.dragging .h{border-color:var(--ui-brand)}\n.h.tl{left:-6px;top:-6px;cursor:nwse-resize}\n.h.tr{right:-6px;top:-6px;cursor:nesw-resize}\n.h.bl{left:-6px;bottom:-6px;cursor:nesw-resize}\n.h.br{right:-6px;bottom:-6px;cursor:nwse-resize}\n\n.sizebar{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}\n.sizebar b{color:var(--ui-text);font-weight:600}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px;gap:6px}\n  .stage{max-width:280px;height:112px}\n  .frame{border-radius:10px}\n  .frame .label{font-size:7px;left:7px;top:5px}\n  .frame .ph{border-radius:7px}\n  .h{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2.5px}\n  .h.tl{left:-5px;top:-5px}\n  .h.tr{right:-5px;top:-5px}\n  .h.bl{left:-5px;bottom:-5px}\n  .h.br{right:-5px;bottom:-5px}\n  .sizebar{font-size:9px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .frame,.h{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">\n  <div class=\"frame\" id=\"frame\">\n    <div class=\"label\">IMAGE / PANEL</div>\n    <div class=\"ph\"></div>\n    <div class=\"h tl\" data-c=\"tl\" role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"从左上角调整大小\"></div>\n    <div class=\"h tr\" data-c=\"tr\" role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"从右上角调整大小\"></div>\n    <div class=\"h bl\" data-c=\"bl\" role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"从左下角调整大小\"></div>\n    <div class=\"h br\" data-c=\"br\" role=\"separator\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"从右下角调整大小\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sizebar\">宽度 <b id=\"w\">280</b> px / 高度 <b id=\"h\">190</b> px</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var stage = document.getElementById('stage'),\n      frame = document.getElementById('frame'),\n      wEl = document.getElementById('w'),\n      hEl = document.getElementById('h');\n\n  var MINW = 110, MINH = 70;\n  var base = null, corner = '', startX = 0, startY = 0;\n  var dragging = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function syncSize(){\n    wEl.textContent = String(Math.round(frame.offsetWidth));\n    hEl.textContent = String(Math.round(frame.offsetHeight));\n  }\n\n  function setBox(l, t, w, h){\n    frame.style.left = l + 'px';\n    frame.style.top = t + 'px';\n    frame.style.width = w + 'px';\n    frame.style.height = h + 'px';\n    syncSize();\n  }\n\n  function placeCenter(w, h){\n    setBox((stage.clientWidth - w) / 2, (stage.clientHeight - h) / 2, w, h);\n  }\n\n  function onDown(e){\n    var hd = e.currentTarget || e.target;\n    corner = hd.getAttribute ? (hd.getAttribute('data-c') || 'br') : 'br';\n    base = {\n      l: frame.offsetLeft,\n      t: frame.offsetTop,\n      w: frame.offsetWidth,\n      h: frame.offsetHeight\n    };\n    startX = e.clientX;\n    startY = e.clientY;\n    dragging = true;\n    frame.classList.add('dragging');\n    if(hd.setPointerCapture && e.pointerId != null){\n      try { hd.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err){}\n    }\n  }\n\n  function onMove(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    var dx = e.clientX - startX;\n    var dy = e.clientY - startY;\n    var L = base.l, T = base.t, W = base.w, H = base.h;\n\n    /* 右/下：直接增减，超限只夹尺寸 */\n    if(corner.indexOf('r') >= 0) W = Math.max(MINW, base.w + dx);\n    if(corner.indexOf('b') >= 0) H = Math.max(MINH, base.h + dy);\n\n    /* 左/上：**对边固定**——先夹位置，再由「对边 - 位置」算出尺寸。\n       这样拖出边界后尺寸不会再跟着继续长（否则会出现「到顶后继续往上、面板反而往下长」） */\n    if(corner.indexOf('l') >= 0){\n      var R = base.l + base.w;\n      L = Math.max(0, Math.min(base.l + dx, R - MINW));\n      W = R - L;\n    }\n    if(corner.indexOf('t') >= 0){\n      var B = base.t + base.h;\n      T = Math.max(0, Math.min(base.t + dy, B - MINH));\n      H = B - T;\n    }\n\n    /* 右/下越界时收缩尺寸 */\n    if(L + W > stage.clientWidth) W = stage.clientWidth - L;\n    if(T + H > stage.clientHeight) H = stage.clientHeight - T;\n\n    setBox(L, T, W, H);\n  }\n\n  function onUp(){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    dragging = false;\n    frame.classList.remove('dragging');\n  }\n\n  var handles = [].slice.call(frame.querySelectorAll('.h'));\n  handles.forEach(function(hd){\n    hd.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n    hd.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n    hd.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n    hd.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n    hd.addEventListener('lostpointercapture', onUp);\n    hd.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n      var step = e.shiftKey ? 32 : 8;\n      var w = frame.offsetWidth, h = frame.offsetHeight;\n      if(e.key === 'ArrowRight') w += step;\n      else if(e.key === 'ArrowLeft') w -= step;\n      else if(e.key === 'ArrowDown') h += step;\n      else if(e.key === 'ArrowUp') h -= step;\n      else return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      setBox(frame.offsetLeft, frame.offsetTop,\n             Math.max(MINW, Math.min(stage.clientWidth - frame.offsetLeft, w)),\n             Math.max(MINH, Math.min(stage.clientHeight - frame.offsetTop, h)));\n    });\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  /* 初始尺寸按舞台的 62% 给，并保底 150×80 */\n  function initBox(){\n    var w = Math.max(150, Math.round(stage.clientWidth * 0.62));\n    var h = Math.max(80, Math.round(stage.clientHeight * 0.62));\n    w = Math.min(w, stage.clientWidth);\n    h = Math.min(h, stage.clientHeight);\n    placeCenter(w, h);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    initBox();\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    var fr = frame.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var startXp = fr.right - 2;\n    var startYp = fr.bottom - 2;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.el.style.transition = 'none';\n    c.el.style.left = startXp + 'px';\n    c.el.style.top = startYp + 'px';\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      var br = frame.querySelector('.h.br');\n      br.setPointerCapture = function(){};\n      onDown({ clientX: startXp, clientY: startYp, currentTarget: br });\n\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      var dur = 900;\n      var dx = stage.clientWidth * 0.16, dy = stage.clientHeight * 0.12;\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = t < .5 ? 2 * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 2) / 2;\n        var x = startXp + dx * e;\n        var y = startYp + dy * e;\n        onMove({ clientX: x, clientY: y });\n        c.el.style.left = x + 'px';\n        c.el.style.top = y + 'px';\n        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\n        else {\n          c.release();\n          onUp();\n          setTimeout(function(){ if(c.hide) c.hide(); }, 300);\n        }\n      }\n      requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4200); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  initBox();\n  window.addEventListener('resize', initBox);\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
